<title>USA: Cyclone due to hit Andra Pradesh in 24 hrs -WSC.</title>
<headline>Cyclone due to hit Andra Pradesh in 24 hrs -WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone 08B, with 65 mph winds and moving west in the Bay of Bengal, is expected to make landfall in Andhra Pradesh, India in about 24 hours, Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>Its top winds when will be near 85 mph.</p>
<p>The storm system is likely to produce heavy rains, flash floods, and local wind damage.</p>
</text>
